## Lessons encoded (do not re-learn)

| Bug | Broken assumption | Where |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Titles clipped, no `…` | Button intrinsic width; not a shrinking flex item | G5, S1 |
| “Fix” with `grid-cols-1` | Second track graph in a content pane | G6, S2 |
| “Fix” with `contain-inline-size` | Escape hatch ≠ formatting model (CQ ≠ truncate) | G4, G10 |
| Sticky header gaps | Margin on sticky vs scrollport | G8, S4 |
| Nested `overflow-hidden` everywhere | Overflow is placement, not seasoning; clips menus | G4, S1 |

## Agent checklist (every UI edit)

- [ ] Named audience: **general** vs **Studio policy**
- [ ] Decision tree run — box A / B / C (or 2D skeleton) named
- [ ] No new flex/grid unless peer row, pane, shell/page, or true 2D skeleton
- [ ] Pane uses G3; only one scroll leaf
- [ ] Truncate uses G5 — not grid/contain hacks
- [ ] CQ `container-type` OK; `contain-*` as truncate **not** OK
- [ ] Studio chrome: also S1–S5
- [ ] Child cannot widen/heighten the pane

